\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Complete PulseFormer generation pipeline. Starting from user-supplied prefix conditioning (Genre, BPM, Key, Energy Level, Structure Tag), the system constructs a Time-Major interleaved token sequence, passes it through a 6-layer causal Transformer with a flat causal LM head over compound event tokens, applies dual algorithmic masks (Energy Density and Diatonic Scale), generates each structural section independently, and stitches all sections into a coherent multi-minute arrangement via Temporal Anchor Offset alignment.}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
